  "description": "Professional HTTP-based SDK for TAF Metadata Service. v7.2.3: Connection endpoints now return List<Connection> directly instead of OperationResult wrapper to simplify JSON deserialization. v7.2.2: Connection controller creates new OperationResult via factory method (matches CustomScript pattern). v7.2.0: BREAKING - Connection endpoints now return TAF.Infra.Contract.Models.Connection (shared model) instead of ConnectionDto. Requires TAF.Infra.Contract v1.5.0. Features Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, industry-standard naming (IMetadataClient), explicit Context parameter support for both HTTP and background thread scenarios, comprehensive error handling, screen management endpoint, batch relations support, and GetAppObjectById endpoint for efficient GUID-based lookups.",
